The spark-shell automatically provides a SparkContext object named sc, which your code uses. Enter this command in your terminal:
spark-shell

// 1. Load the text file into an RDD
val rdd = sc.textFile("input.txt")

// 2. Tokenize, map to pairs, and reduce by key
val counts = rdd.flatMap(line => line.split(" ")).map(word => (word, 1)).reduceByKey(_ + _)

// 3. Print the results to the console
counts.collect().foreach(println)

